    {
      "id": "chapter-1",
      "title": "Greetings before arrival!",
      "description": "My favorite part of flying is looking out from the window. So after checking paths of recent HKG to NRT flights, I checked in to a seat on the left side, hoping to get a good view of Japan before I land. I did not expect to be blessed by a view of Mt. Fuji as we got closer to Tokyo!",
