    {
      "id": "chapter-2",
      "title": "Bus ride to Fujikawaguchiko",
      "description": "After struggling to spot Mt. Fuji from Tokyo for a few days, I took a bus nearly at noon to stay next to Lake Kawaguchi for one night. I was frantically checking our location & looking out of the window, hoping that it wouldn’t be too cloudy. I caught a few glimpses of Mt. Fuji from the bus as I arrived.",
